   <p class="legal">NCLEX®, NCLEX-RN®, and Next Generation NCLEX® are registered trademarks of the National Council of State Boards of Nursing, Inc. (NCSBN). Vexcura is an independent study tool and is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by NCSBN or Pearson VUE. Questions are original practice items, not actual NCLEX questions. For educational purposes only; not medical advice. ACLS content is for practice and is not an American Heart Association course or certification.</p>
